From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Chagas <drochachagas@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:10:59 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Shape tool: triangle, polygon, star, line and custom shapes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The rest of Photoshop's shape tools as Shape options: Triangle; Polygon
(sides, star, indent); Line from the press to the release (weight, Shift
for 45° steps); Custom Shape (heart, star, arrow, speech bubble, burst,
check mark, lightning, cross). Tool options show only the chosen shape's
settings, and the preview while dragging is the outline of the very shape
the release draws.

